<title>USA: Merck to file NDA for angina drug later this year.</title>
<headline>Merck to file NDA for angina drug later this year.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merck and Co Inc said Monday that it plans to file a new drug application later this year for its Aggrastat drug.</p>
<p>The company said Phase III clinical trials showed Aggrastat prevented the combination of heart attack, death and other cardiac complications by more than one-third in people suffering from unstable angina.</p>
</text>
